#: ../../tools/rgd_tools.rst:32 fa77b7b744494c459b842a90ef2301fe
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get disease, phenotype, pathway, and GO annotations for "
"a rat gene from RGD. Returns curated annotations with ontology terms, "
"evidence codes, and qualifiers. Filter by aspect: D=Disease, P=Pathway, "
"W=Phenotype, F=Molecular Function, C=Cellular Component, E=Expression. "
"Essential for rat disease model research and toxicogenomics."
msgstr ""

