"Database by RGD ID. Returns gene symbol, name, description (including "
"AGR-aggregated functional summary with disease associations, pathways, "
"and interactions), gene type, and Ensembl cross-reference. Use when "
"looking up specific rat genes for toxicology, pharmacology, or disease "
"model research."
